# journal.carlosmartinezt.com
#
# The PWA is deployed to Vercel now (journal-rho-lac.vercel.app), so this box
# no longer builds or serves it. The live Caddy block is a permanent redirect:
#
#     journal.carlosmartinezt.com {
#         redir https://journal-rho-lac.vercel.app{uri} permanent
#     }
#
# A redirect rather than a DNS change because DNS for this name still points at
# the Hetzner box. The tidier end state is journal.carlosmartinezt.com added as
# a custom domain on the Vercel project, which removes the hop and this file
# with it.
#
# The self-hosted block that used to live here (root * ~/journal/dist, SPA
# fallback, immutable asset caching) is in git history if it is ever needed. Do
# not restore it without also restoring a build step: serving straight out of
# dist/ inside the repo is the arrangement that took this site offline when a
# disk sweep deleted the directory. See ~/CLAUDE.md, "Source is not deployment".
